# Mirrors aos/shipped.py: an sdist must carry everything the wheel build copies into aos/_shipped.
# Root files only get in through `include`, so agents.local.toml and *.lock at the root never do.
include CONTRIBUTING.md SECURITY.md aos.toml routines.toml agents.toml aos_tick.pyw
graft agents
graft skills
graft docs
graft examples
prune agents/local
prune examples/vault/AI/Digest
prune examples/vault/.obsidian
global-exclude *.py[cod] *.lock .DS_Store ._* Thumbs.db desktop.ini
